WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:17.396
Peter looked at Benjamin.

2
00:00:17.397 --> 00:00:24.366
"Silvertail is the nut thief!"

3
00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:28.400
The bunnies ran to the squirrels.

4
00:00:28.401 --> 00:00:32.732
"We found the nut thief!" Peter said.

5
00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:35.364
"Go away!" a squirrel said.

6
00:00:35.365 --> 00:00:39.135
"This is not bunny business," another yelled.

7
00:00:39.136 --> 00:00:42.232
"It is squirrel business!"

8
00:00:42.233 --> 00:00:44.683
Timmy looked at the bunnies.

9
00:00:44.684 --> 00:00:48.376
"Who is the nut thief?" he asked.

10
00:00:48.377 --> 00:00:51.281
"Come with us," Benjamin said.

11
00:00:51.282 --> 00:00:54.935
"We will show you."

12
00:00:54.936 --> 00:01:06.168
Timmy followed the bunnies.

13
00:01:06.169 --> 00:01:11.635
They showed him Silvertail's hiding spot.

14
00:01:11.636 --> 00:01:13.947
Timmy's eyes got big.

15
00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:16.775
"Wow!" he said.

16
00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:20.229
"Silvertail is stealing our nuts!

17
00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:24.244
We must stop him."

18
00:01:24.245 --> 00:01:27.172
Benjamin saw a hollow tree.

19
00:01:27.173 --> 00:01:30.852
It had a hole in its trunk.

20
00:01:30.853 --> 00:01:37.670
"Hmm," Benjamin said. "I have an idea."

21
00:01:37.671 --> 00:01:44.009
The bunnies got some nuts.

22
00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:48.886
They hopped to the hollow tree.

23
00:01:48.887 --> 00:01:53.697
Then they pushed the nuts into the hole.

24
00:01:53.698 --> 00:02:12.244
"Now let's find Silvertail!" Benjamin said.

25
00:02:12.245 --> 00:02:14.888
Silvertail was taking a nap.

26
00:02:14.889 --> 00:02:24.368
"Hi, Silvertail!" Peter woke him up.

27
00:02:24.369 --> 00:02:27.172
"We found lots of nuts.

28
00:02:27.173 --> 00:02:29.596
Would you like some?"

29
00:02:29.597 --> 00:02:35.157
"Yes!" Silvertail licked his lips.

30
00:02:35.158 --> 00:02:39.337
"Where are they?"
